Type: Package
Package: UnalR
Title: Visualization Tools for the National University of Colombia
Version: 1.0.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jeison", "Alarcón", , "jmalarconbe@unal.edu.co", role = c("aut", "cre", "ctr"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1517-7840")),
    person("Alberto", "Rodríguez", , "albrodriguezr@unal.edu.co", role = c("aut", "rev")),
    person("Dirección Nacional de Planeación y Estadística", "Universidad Nacional de Colombia", , "estadistica_nal@unal.edu.co", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Provides fast and consistent functions for arranging microdata
    and visualizing official statistics from the National University of
    Colombia <https://unal.edu.co>. Offers a library of static and interactive
    graphical functions with a highly configurable and simple syntax. Features
    include HTML tables, time series, bar and pie charts, and maps supported
    by various JavaScript libraries. Allows seamless transitions between
    interactive and static graphics. Spanish: Proporciona funciones rápidas y
    consistentes para la disposición de microdatos y la visualización de
    estadísticas oficiales de la Universidad Nacional de Colombia
    <https://unal.edu.co>. Ofrece una biblioteca de funciones gráficas estáticas
    e interactivas con una sintaxis simple y altamente configurable. Incluye
    tablas HTML, series de tiempo, gráficos de barras y circulares, y mapas
    apoyados en bibliotecas de JavaScript.
